{
	"set": "zuiddrecht",
	"title": "Gemeente Zuiddrecht",
	"$comment": "The cast of the Zuiddrecht example set, and OpenRegister's own fragment: a BRP row per cast person with a BSN and a KVK row and branch per business. Installed with `occ openregister:example-set:install zuiddrecht`; every other app adds its part in its own lib/Settings/example-sets/zuiddrecht.json and refers to cast members with {{cast:key.field}} and to other apps' objects only through a lookup on a business key (BSN, KVK number). Zuiddrecht is fictitious. BSNs are 11-proof numbers from the BRP test block 999990000-999999999 and appear nowhere else in the fleet's registers; KVK numbers are fictitious; municipality code 9999 belongs to no municipality.",
	"timezone": "Europe/Amsterdam",
	"requires": [
		{
			"register": "brp",
			"mock": true
		},
